OL,3,GNEWSAOil tanker lorry destroyed by fire
OL,4,Aon residential street
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn oil tanker lorry has been destroyed
OL,7,Fby fire in a residential area close to
OL,8,FGlenavon Football Club.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called to the
OL,11,Fincident at Mourneview Avenue in
OL,12,FLurgan, County Armagh at 11:43 BST on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FA huge cloud of thick, black smoke was
OL,16,Fseen rising over the area as the lorry
OL,17,Fburned.
OL,19,FThree fire service appliances were sent
OL,20,Fto the scene and firefighters have
OL,21,Fsince extinguished the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
